// Ch10 B07 Kirru bark 2: a mother, about her child. With Toma's line if he knelt with Ivo at Corrow
// (he watches a Kirru mother carry her child on her back through the water).
title: ch10_bark_kirru_mother
location: ch10/reedhollow
---
Kirru as "Kirru mother" [soft_smile]: She asks too many questions. Good. #line:ch10_kirru_mother_001
<<if $ch09_toma_knelt_with_ivo>>
    @anim toma look_at kirru
    Toma [sad]: They called them soulless. At the Bastion. Every morning, in the prayers. #line:ch10_kirru_mother_002
<<endif>>
===
